            <span>Import Emails from Hostinger or External IMAP</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Copies Inbox, Sent, Drafts, Trash, Spam, and custom folders safely without deleting messages on the old server.</p>
