          <button type="submit" id="btnStartImport" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold shadow-xs cursor-pointer shrink-0">
            <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-base leading-none" aria-hidden="true">cloud_download</span>
            <span>Start Import</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Tip: Once a migration job finishes cleanly, click its delete icon so your old Hostinger password does not remain saved on the mail server.</p>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-brand-surface rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-brand-border shadow-xs overflow-hidden">
